{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-03_end","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-03","title":"深淵之側","storyCode":"15-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"54d52061051d8a7960007d90b06a4e4333851e558ee553700b47f7544d89e699","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"PRTS出現異常。為保護幹員和資產，凱爾希開始著手準備羅德島本艦的拆分和保護工作，以應對可能來自內部區域Abyss的危機。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，我有權拒絕你所提出的數據模組檢查與更新。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法接受如同THRM-EX和Lancet-2一般的待遇。你很清楚，我和其他那幾位有趣的“同事”本質並不相同。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，放心，這次不是騙你升級模組。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那請恢復我的移動模組供電，限制一位受尊敬的學者的人身自由是非常無禮的行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請看著我的表情塗裝，它現在已經向你展示了我的心情——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“生氣”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會花太長時間的，“正義騎士號”可是還在門口排隊等著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗里斯頓先生，我保證這次維護會非常快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，這樣就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你封鎖了我從PRTS讀取數據的功能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封鎖？不不不，我直接將你從PRTS中離線了，物理意義上。我拆除了你的接收模組。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看起來問題不大嘛，還以為會有不可修復的故障。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在對我動手前沒有做過任何預案？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，現在感覺如何，弗里斯頓先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已對你在實驗中有悖操作準則的違規操作全程錄影，稍後我會同凱爾希討論你在工作上的疏忽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及對我生命安全的不尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——弗里斯頓先生，請再次自檢，確認已經完全無法接收到PRTS的訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該慶幸沒有出任何紕漏，我的確沒辦法再連入到PRTS中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……就像眼睛看不清了一樣。這種感覺很微妙，我並不喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們能好好聊聊了，弗里斯頓先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我想將所有的改型作業平台全部與PRTS斷聯，有沒有更妥當的操作辦法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒絕假想如此高風險的操作，這與殺死我那些可愛的“同事”無異——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果……我們不得不這麼做呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請告知我你得出這種結論的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們發現了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐，現在能檢查出PRTS最近幾次執行錯誤的根源了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日誌顯示大部分錯誤都是同事們偶然操作失誤引起的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唔，又是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，備用系統已經在加快部署了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按凱爾希的建議，新的獨立終端指揮系統試用版重新更新了框架。我幫它取了個名字，叫ZOOT。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"管理員的權限暫時開放給了博士、凱爾希、阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然還有我。我當初設計這套系統架構時的許多理念現在看來都有些過時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真想徹底推翻了它重新設計，但是凱爾希駁回了我的申請！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"時間並不寬裕。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"能直接銜接到新終端指揮系統嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這個需求還在努力中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS在羅德島的日常運轉中依舊無法替代，大量醫療數據和資源調配的演算都必須依賴它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但最大的阻礙，其實是如何搭建一個足夠可靠的資料中心和能源中心，以支持新指揮系統的運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS在這方面的潛力無可比擬，完成羅德島大量的高精細度演算需求的同時，它仍有餘力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜實在弄不懂它的核心原理……哪怕完全模仿它設計的ZOOT也總是會在預料不到的奇怪地方出錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果藉助“阿喃那”呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐，我看到了你在我提交的報告上的批註和猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依照卡茲戴爾辦事處對“阿喃那”的數據記錄以及實驗，理論上的確存在利用“阿喃那”作為數據和能源中心的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"同樣具有風險。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們尚不完全熟悉“阿喃那”。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也不是毫無收穫啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我們驗證了藉助“阿喃那”實現超遠距離通訊和數據傳輸的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕已經有提前打過招呼，但維什戴爾小姐突然收到你的“問好”時還是嚇了一大跳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"去增援卡茲戴爾辦事處的幹員還習慣嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛去時大家的確很驚訝，他們大多慣常地認為那座城市會更……糟糕一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過幹員們都習慣得很快，月見夜先生和我一起返回時，甚至都還有點捨不得在那邊新認識的朋友們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們如今還有必要繼續向各地的辦事處增派人手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒見本艦像現在這樣冷清過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平淡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經達成過共識，可露希爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平淡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向各地辦事處增派人手既是為了減少他們在本艦遭受意外的風險，也是為了保證各地辦事處能更有效率地採取可能的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然知道，只是有點不習慣突然和朋友們告別罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道從什麼時候開始，我的行程安排上好像排滿了送別宴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們排除了本艦的所有風險之後，幹員們何時開始回到原先的職位上同樣取決於你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人已經到齊的話，我們就正式開始會議吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，記得把我們今天的語音備份和數據備份從PRTS中刪除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，我們作出的每一個決定都關乎羅德島的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經達成了共識，如果要以最穩妥的方式保障羅德島人員和資產的安全，一些決定勢在必行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"簡化本艦結構。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，盡可能分離“羅德島”號的重要資產，並安頓駐留本艦的人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣能在減輕駐艦人員顧慮的同時，提高大家應對突發情況的速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，但我還是有點疑問，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這意味著要拆解本艦絕大部分的結構……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，您決定加快本艦防衛布局的原因只是PRTS最近的異常嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近期的種種異常狀態，在表明一個事實——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS正在逐漸失控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並且隨著時間推進，失控的程度，只會越發加深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，PRTS只是羅德島的終端控制系統啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果它不再受我們控制，又是根據誰的指令在執行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您擔心威脅來自內部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，這種可能性一直都存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我相信您，凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，真是頭痛啊。博士，你覺得呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我相信凱爾希的判斷。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我和她早已預演過上百份預案。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我還能做些什麼，凱爾希？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在艦體改建上目前已經幫了很大的忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連接不同核心區域的機械結構在這五年的時間裡，幾乎完全替換成了環烴預製材料，可以支援一定程度上的模組化拆解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一定程度上？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下層甲板的能源動力區域和頂層甲板暫時無法拆分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“羅德島”號最初被挖掘出來時受技術和形勢所限，來不及修繕到完美狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七年前我和可露希爾繪製改造羅德島的藍圖時，才發現本艦整體框架結構已經積重難返，能做到如今的程度已經難能可貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的各模組中，天災預警系統以及醫療中心至關重要。它們都涉及一系列暫時不宜公開的技術，安置起來也最為棘手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"哥倫比亞？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們與萊茵生命的合作關係十分緊密，交由他們代為保管預警系統和醫療中心顯然是合理的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但馬克·麥克斯長期以來都對羅德島保持了較高的關注度，我無法預測分析哥倫比亞總統會如何看待我們兩家企業之間的合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加之特里蒙如今的形勢依舊複雜，恐怕萊茵生命都無法確保能獨善其身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個冒險的想法。"}]},{"label":"阿戈爾？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……冒險的決定，但很合理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"透過克萊門莎和歌蕾蒂婭的私人管道，我們甚至不必與阿戈爾官方建立聯絡。我可以確保這件事被低調地妥當安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至我們能順便展開技術交流，華法琳對此應該會很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我贊同這個想法。"}]},{"label":"倫蒂尼姆？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆議會這兩年多以來的重建工作很艱難，但他們取得的成果同樣令人驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不僅清除了大部分航道上的源石晶簇，還終於穩定了城內的藥物與資源供給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今倫蒂尼姆的確能為醫療中心提供一個安全的運作環境，我們也能獲得大量的一手病例資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這意味著我們將再次從官方層面上和議會達成合作，公爵方面會再次向維娜施加大量的壓力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這對剛剛步入正軌的倫蒂尼姆來說不算好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我有另一個冒險的想法。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾。目前綜合判斷來看，這是最適合的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會親自與審判庭和阿戈爾相關人員溝通，確保我們的人員和資產安全抵達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的病人現在大都已經提前隨增援幹員暫時安頓到了各地辦事處的治療機構。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只需要等到醫療中心恢復運作，剩下的病人就可以全部轉移到阿戈爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事就交給我吧，長途運送患者的保障載具已經可以投入使用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，有關後勤部和工程部的轉移安排……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也徵求了同事們的意見，大家對暫時搬遷到卡茲戴爾都很有激情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人都是當年和我們一起撐過來的老夥伴，重新回到卡茲戴爾對他們而言意味著很多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我在離開卡茲戴爾前已經和維什戴爾小姐溝通過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴別塔會安排人手全程護送我們的人員和重要資產。有巴別塔和軍事委員會聯合行動的旗號在，周邊的傭兵不敢擅自行動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還有我們的開採模組。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"軍事化改造過的開採模組需要慎重處理。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很早之前我就從雷姆必拓購置了一艘半退役的開採艦，並註冊登記在羅德島的名下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本艦的開採模組已經可以合法地轉接到新的開採艦上，在雷姆必拓境內繼續運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也同時在市場上放出了採購新開採模組的訂單。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"掩人耳目？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"短期內本艦出現大規模的變動，一定會引起其他人的注意，尤其是我們的競爭對手，極有可能會趁機對我們動用一些手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然“本艦升級重建”會是一個不同勢力官方層面可以接受的說法，但真正有所企圖的人對羅德島的異動一定心知肚明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要一些更縝密的應對手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在返艦之前途經敘拉古進行物資補給時，在新沃爾西尼拜訪了伺夜先生和斥罪小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們協助我對新沃爾西尼現在的城市狀況做了一定考察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在家族勢力無法明目張膽地影響新沃爾西尼的前提下，市政廳可以為我們提供保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議以投資的方式將我們的商務部門安置在新沃爾西尼，和市政廳展開合作，以此來應對其他競爭公司或明或暗的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你覺得呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我同意阿米婭的想法。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"也許還可以建立備用的補給商店和倉庫。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以在新沃爾西尼一併建造備用物資倉庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新沃爾西尼的物流系統近一年的變化很大，港口貨物輸送量極為驚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有市政廳的配合，我們運輸保存的重要資產也更容易保密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，其他還有一些輔助設施就交給我去和大家對接吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還剩最後一件麻煩事……"},{"type":"narration","text":"眾人看著面前被攤開的藍圖，指揮中心完全安靜了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是我們一切行動的關鍵。"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希指向藍圖中央的一片區域。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……Abyss……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i17"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Abyss。"},{"type":"narration","text":"藍圖上清晰地標註著，中層甲板的核心區域原本空白的地方被塗出了一塊新的區域——\nAbyss。\n長期以來，凱爾希從不向你解釋Abyss意味著什麼。\n但你依舊隱隱感覺到，這塊在藍圖上被塗出的區域，這塊從未被PRTS記錄過的區域——\n與你有著千絲萬縷的聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"距離它上一次開啟，已經過去了漫長的歲月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使當初我不得不靠近那裡找回那個重要的人，我也不敢冒險靠近那片塵封在更深處的區域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在，連我也無法確認其中到底發生了怎樣的變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如剛才所說，PRTS的異常要是有某種緣由，那Abyss必然牽涉其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你認為我們應當如何處理這塊區域，Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我也毫無頭緒。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我需要前往這裡進行調查。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，我可以陪同——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會親自帶博士前往。阿米婭、可露希爾，我需要你們確保周邊的區域完全淨空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以Abyss為中心，在其附近區域建立第一條隔離帶，並在以本艦為中心的一公里範圍內建立第二條隔離帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"除去阿斯卡綸和精英幹員留艦待命以外，我需要其他在艦人員暫時離艦做好應對措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你和可露希爾同樣暫時離艦，隨時準備啟動備用預案應對意外情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時間呢？如此大規模的行動很難在短時間內完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"十五日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在此期間，我需要你配合我完成全面的身體數據檢測和數據比對，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我會配合。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，Abyss裡到底有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一切的起點，一切的終點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，我想先去Abyss那裡看看。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希似乎明白了你的用意，隨即輕輕點了點頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過在我們完全準備好之前，只能在外圍進行一些初步的探索。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我會小心的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能繼續深入了。我無法判斷你繼續靠近Abyss的核心區域是否會引發一些意料之外的變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡和真正的Abyss還有一定的距離，我也沒有打開通向Abyss的道路的權限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我依然在進行一些嘗試，但目前進展甚微。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"按你所言，這是我最初從泰拉醒來的地方？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……物理層面上而言，的確如此。但你的情況要複雜得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到這裡，你是否還能想起任何事情？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是某種試探嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這是某種調侃嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希搖了搖頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是希望確認你的身體無恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從倫蒂尼姆撤出之後，我們在特里蒙和彌利亞留姆的行動都不可避免地觸及了這片大地的過往……你的過往。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我在源石內化宇宙中窺探到了我的使命。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i35"},{"type":"narration","text":"——這片大地的拯救者。\n——這片大地的毀滅者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，我避無可避，也無需逃避。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，在很久之前，我便不再質疑你的決心。否則，我們現在也不會在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，關於Abyss的真相，我有一個猜測。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她在這裡。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"普瑞賽斯在這裡？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是你選擇讓這場對話避開阿米婭和可露希爾的原因。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我還沒有想好該如何告訴她們。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"畢竟對此我所知道的也並不全面。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，但我們遲早要為此做好準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭雖然還年輕，但是我們經歷過的每一件事都讓她往一個成熟領袖的方向成長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也永遠可以相信可露希爾的知識與技術，而且對於羅德島，她也在肩負起更多的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們都值得你信賴和倚靠，都是將要與你繼續同行很久的同伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"當然。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你也一樣。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但是現在，我們需要先弄清楚——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"PRTS究竟發生了什麼。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在內化宇宙的遭遇本就充滿了疑點，而特蕾西婭與特雷西斯聯手奪下那枚最初的源石後……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心底便一直有一種最壞的猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許在“阿喃那”降臨的時刻，她已甦醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可是，那已經是三年前的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法完全確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯極有可能採用了某些我無法溯源的手段切斷了掌控者與源石的聯繫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們拖延了她的到來？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“拖延”恐怕並非準確的描述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不得不承認，他們完成了一件我從未想像過的壯舉，也客觀上為我們爭取了更多的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，美夢終有甦醒的時刻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"聽起來，我們必須要打開Abyss。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，畢竟至今PRTS依舊在運轉，它的核心伺服器和所需能量來源一直被保存在Abyss的深處。不可觸及，不可分析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面對其中的未知空間，我們再怎樣謹慎都不為過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於它，我會向參與行動的所有人解釋我目前所知的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我可以幫你做什麼嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……對於現在的你來說，接觸這些若即若離的過去是一種沉重的負擔，而我暫時也沒有辦法能幫你卸下這種負擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多去幫幫阿米婭和其他人吧，Abyss的問題就交給我來處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你願意相信我的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"當然。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我只是想讓你知道。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，你並非孤身一人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你的關心，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"使用者：凱爾希\n你好，凱爾希，我們又見面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你看起來需要我的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請搜尋一份技術檔案，關鍵字，“安眠橋”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還在嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在。\n抱歉，凱爾希，我依舊無法輸出你想要的答案。\n你越界了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我們需要它，“特蕾西婭”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病演變的速度正在加快，源石的威脅也在日益加深，羅德島必須找到更有效的手段來應對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n我理解你的理由，但我無法提供，你的請求違背了DWDB-221E的核心邏輯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n但我可以提供繞過限制的方法，凱爾希——\n“深潛”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g1_rhodescorridor_bc"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“宇宙”？“深潛”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您所描述的，還有我所看到的……都太過超越想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對這個國度，我有太多的疑問和想法，但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"語言。無法描述。你的。無法解釋。我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共性。思維。存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"破解思維。破解語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"思維。是。語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟隨我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc"},{"type":"narration","text":"龐大的儀器瞬間吸引了卡特斯的目光。\n她感覺到天旋地轉，儀器扭曲了光，也扭曲了她的意識。\n在卡特斯的眼中，它時而以肉眼無法捕捉的速度旋轉，時而卻又完全靜止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，它、它好像還是在動，很慢……很慢。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她不敢再直視那個似乎可以完全吞噬她意識的儀器，卻也控制不住身體的倒下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那位冰冷的同行者接住了她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"思維。共振。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接受。它。放棄。抵抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聆聽。自己。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“死亡”。\n卡特斯瞬間聽到了數種不同的音調……\n雷姆必拓語、烏薩斯語、維多利亞語，還有她從教士口中聽聞過的高盧語。而更多的，是她從未聽聞過的奇異音調。\n但她卻詭異地理解了那個詞語的含義——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪的音調）“死亡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪的音調）♫"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我能聽懂您的聲音……為什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"思維可以被錨定，言語可以被破解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"語言是工具，是權利，也是重塑我們存在的元素之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安塞塔，是這一個時間片段中最為偉大的發明之一。我們抹除了語言的障礙，我們填補了文明的隔閡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個符號……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"思維的錨，解釋所有已知語言的元文字，也是解析未知語言的工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“死亡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是如今你所思考最多的言語，希爾達。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“降生”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你們的交流方式……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聲音的交流效率不高，但充滿了趣味，反映我們的情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多人依舊固執地保留了這樣的傳統，加深彼此之間的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我並不完全理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在您能告訴我，這裡是什麼地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一艘在墳墓中打撈死亡的航船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在被光照亮的廢墟中尋找解答終極問題的答案……在同樣的毀滅降臨於我們的身上之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在“死亡”降臨之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所造訪的地方，它的主人稱呼它為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“羅德島”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯感到困惑。\n她不再為所處環境的奇異而困惑，她困惑的是……\n神明，為什麼會死去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
